{
    "filename": "10-11-26",
    "date": "10/10/26",
    "title": "solo trip to Okinawa and Taiwan",
    "tags": [
        "life",
        "travel"
    ],
    "content": "<p>I made another solo trip to Taiwan (Tainan and Taipei this time) and Naha, Okinawa for the first time from 10/02 - 10/09! :D I flew EVA Air (787-9) on their new direct route from IAD <-> TPE and Starlux Airlines from TPE <-> OKA. From TPE -> OKA, I flew an A350-900 and on the way back an A330neo.\n</p><p>Some airplane pics:\n</p><p>EVA Air:\n</p><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261001_020637.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261001_022312.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261001_023218.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261001_024559.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261001_072005.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261001_073001.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261001_163407.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261001_165454.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261001_170718.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261009_205602.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261010_065440.webp\" alt=\"\"><br /><br /><p>Starlux Airlines (they provided meals even though the flight between OKA and TPE is only around an hour! :O):\n</p><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261002_152816.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261004_164327.webp\" alt=\"\"><br /><br /><h2>Naha, Okinawa (\u90a3\u8987)\n</h2><p>I just stayed in Naha for a couple days (well, more like 1 evening, 1 full day, and 1 morning lol) but it was enough time to see a fair bit of things and try some good food, imo! :D \n</p><p>I stayed at a hotel next to Kokusai-dori, which was super convenient! \n</p><p>Here's the view from my room.\n</p><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261004_055911.webp\" alt=\"\"><br /><br /><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261002_190311.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261002_194826.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261002_195953.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261002_200006.webp\" alt=\"\"><p>There were a lot of shisa (\u30b7\u30fc\u30b5\u30fc) around! :D\n</p><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261003_061457.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261003_065408.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261003_065721.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261003_065731.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261003_081805.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261003_082937.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261003_085401.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261004_062756.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261004_063531.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261004_063536.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261004_135743.webp\" alt=\"\"><p>I tried goya chanpuru (\u30b4\u30fc\u30e4\u30fc\u30c1\u30e3\u30f3\u30d7\u30eb\u30fc), jimami tofu (\u30b8\u30fc\u30de\u30df\u30fc\u8c46\u8150) and umibudou (\u6d77\u3076\u3069\u3046) on my first night. I especially liked the jimami tofu - sweet, very peanut-y and stretchy :). Apparently it's not actually tofu at all (i.e. made from soybeans) - it's peanut starch! :O\n</p><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261002_192307.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261002_192238.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261002_192235.webp\" alt=\"\"><p>I went to see Naminoue Shrine (\u6ce2\u4e0a\u5bae),\n</p><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261003_063942.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261003_064140.webp\" alt=\"\"><p>checked out Shuri Castle (\u9996\u91cc\u57ce), which had some nice views,\n</p><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261003_091321.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261003_092054.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261003_092257.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261003_092414.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261003_091145.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261003_092018.webp\" alt=\"\"><p>saw this cat on the way there \ud83d\ude38,\n</p><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261003_085322.webp\" alt=\"\"><p>and went to see the Shuri Kinjo-cho Stone-Paved Path (\u9996\u91cc\u91d1\u57ce\u753a\u77f3\u7573\u9053). Pretty neat.\n</p><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261003_095020.webp\" alt=\"\"><br /><br /><p>I also had some supermarket sushi (which included ootoro :O) that I thought was pretty good, especially given the price!\n</p><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261003_164214.webp\" alt=\"\"><p>and of course I had to try sata andagi, which I got at Makishi Public Market. It was pretty good I thought.\n</p><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261003_150813.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261003_150818.webp\" alt=\"\"><br /><br /><h2>Tainan, Taiwan (\u53f0\u5357)\n</h2><p>I stayed near the Tainan TRA station, which is a great location and fairly close to a lot of historic sights to see in downtown Tainan.\n</p><h3>Military aircraft! :D\n</h3><p>Was pleasantly surprised at the constant jet noise in Tainan :). Everyday there were C-130s and AIDC F-CK-1s flying around so jet noise is a common occurrence. The fighters were frequently flying in pairs :O.\n</p><video width=\"250px\" controls> <source src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261005_100343.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" /> </video><video width=\"250px\" controls> <source src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261006_081523.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" /> </video><h3>Chihkan Tower (\u8d64\u5d01\u6a13)\n</h3><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261005_091915.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261005_092916.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261005_093057.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261005_094727.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261005_100631.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261005_100636.webp\" alt=\"\"><h3>Grand Mazu Temple (\u5927\u5929\u540e\u5bae)\n</h3><p>There's lots of nice temples in Tainan (well, all over Taiwan really I suppose and Tainan is no exception). This one is one of the bigger and older ones I explored!\n</p><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261005_101202.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261005_101254.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261005_101323.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261005_101411.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261005_101454.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261005_101519.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261005_101604.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261005_102339.webp\" alt=\"\"><h3>Confucius Temple (\u81fa\u5357\u5b54\u5edf)\n</h3><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261005_123828.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261005_123956.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261005_124048.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261005_124246.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261005_124521.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261005_124548.webp\" alt=\"\"><h3>Anping (\u5b89\u5e73)\n</h3><p>I went to Anping, where Fort Zeelandia/Anping Fort (\u5b89\u5e73\u53e4\u5821) is, which came out of the Dutch colonization of Taiwan in the 1600s. \n</p><p>I took Bus 102 to get there, which has a stop near Tainan Station.\n</p><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261006_081219.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261006_091723.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261006_093218.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261006_093143.webp\" alt=\"\"><br /><br /><p>misc food pics of stuff I ate in Tainan:\n</p><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261005_104019.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261005_104449.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261005_134131.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261005_174718.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261006_064654.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261006_110944.webp\" alt=\"\"><br /><br /><h2>Taipei, Taiwan (\u53f0\u5317)\n</h2><p>they're making good progress on these 2 buildings right next to Taipei Main Station :D.\n</p><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261007_130743.webp\" alt=\"\"><p>I hiked up Xiangshan (\u8c61\u5c71) again :). They were doing some construction there as well this time around.\n</p><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261007_150745.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261007_145923.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261007_152328.webp\" alt=\"\"><p>I went to the new terminal station on the MRT's red line, Guangci/Fengtian Temple and checked out Fengtian Temple and hiked up Hushan (\u864e\u5c71), which was close by, for the first time. It was a bit of a weird hike to get to but it has great views!\n</p><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261007_155359.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261007_155629.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261007_161132.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261007_162733.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261007_162738.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261007_163448.webp\" alt=\"\"><p>I also went to Sanxia Old Street (\u4e09\u5cfd\u8001\u8857) and took the new Sanying MRT line that opened earlier this summer.\n</p><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261009_120929.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261009_125241.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261009_125334.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261009_131059.webp\" alt=\"\"><br /><br /><p>misc food pics of stuff I ate in Taipei:\n</p><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261007_174445.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261007_192751.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261008_114047.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261008_115517.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"\" src=\"blog_entries/images/okinawa + taiwan trip 2026/20261008_163311.webp\" alt=\"\">"
}